# The web app is all Vercel needs. Exclude the native desktop crate — its Rust
# build output (src-tauri/target) is gigabytes and was blowing up the upload,
# stalling deploys. None of this ships to the web runtime.
#
# NOTE: do NOT ignore *.dmg/*.exe globally — public/downloads/*.dmg is the Mac
# installer the /download page serves and must be uploaded.
src-tauri
.firecrawl
